  <div class="container">
    <div class="stage-practice" style="max-width:820px;margin:0 auto"><p><strong>Short answer</strong>If you are moving an elderly parent, Chayce can handle the sorting, packing, a fully insured removal and settling in, working with the whole family and putting your parent's wishes first. We are based in Northampton, work across the UK, use DBS-checked staff and offer a &pound;150 Discovery Consultation to plan the move.</p></div>
